<p>U<sub>rel</sub> = √(u<sub>rel(pooled)</sub>² + u<sub>cal</sub>²) × 2 = √(${(r.u_rw||0).toFixed(2)}² + ${(r.ucal||0).toFixed(2)}²) × 2 = <strong>${(r.u_extended||0).toFixed(2)}%</strong>（k=2）</p>
